# Static items. Arithmetic and context-ladder items are synthesized in quick_eval.py so expected values are computed.
# Fields: id, category, prompt, check{type,...}, optional system, tools. Lines starting with # are ignored.

# ---- recall: long-tail single-answer facts; quant damage shows here first. Case-insensitive substring match.
